OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly cloud and rain will clear
OL,6,Fto the southeast to leave a mostly dry
OL,7,Fday with plenty of sunny spells then
OL,8,Ffollowing. The odd shower is possible
OL,9,Ftowards north and west, but most will
OL,10,Fremain dry. Rather breezy for all.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FEarly evening showers easing
OL,13,Fto leave a mostly dry night with clear
OL,14,Fspells. Winds also easing a little by
OL,15,Fmorning.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FDry at first, but increasingly
OL,18,Fcloudy as rain moves in from the west
OL,19,Fduring the morning. Turning heavy for
OL,20,Fa time, especially over western hills.
OL,21,FRather windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
