OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy on Saturday and Sunday with
OL,7,Fpatchy rain and stronger winds.
OL,8,FBrighter to the east of high ground.
OL,9,FDrier, brighter and a little warmer on
OL,10,FMonday with lighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
